1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Glasses. Keys. The pill bottle.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Every search is a call to the family.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Maya remembers, so they don't have to.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Maya, I can't find my glasses.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Your glasses were last seen at 7:41 on the side table to your right. Let us look there together.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Maya, where are my glasses?

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Your glasses were last seen at 7:41 on the side table, to your right.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Clear glasses in a 1080p wide shot. One ID for the whole clip.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,000
This is my medicine. I take it twice a day after eating.

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Thank you for telling me. I saved this as unconfirmed for Yuki to check.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Can I take another one?

12
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
I will check with Yuki for you. Let us wait a little together.

13
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Maya has no tool that can write a reminder.

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Mum says: pill bottle, twice a day after meals. Confirm?

15
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:55,000
The caregiver writes every reminder.

16
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Simulated: no signs of activity since 9:12. Good morning. Are you up?

17
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Same clip, same prompts: YOLO11, RT-DETR, Grounding DINO, SAM 3.1.

18
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:45,000
The models perceive and phrase. Our code decides.

19
00:02:45,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Watching over, without watching. Not a medical device.
